      "id": "deployment-notes",
      "name": "Deployment notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "width": 680,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Configure before publishing\nSelect encrypted Crypto v2 HMAC and model HTTP credentials. Set SAMARTH_APP_ORIGIN, SAMARTH_LLM_CHAT_URL, SAMARTH_REPORT_MODEL, SAMARTH_REPORT_PROTOCOL (openai or ollama). This HTTP model node needs its own credential; inspect the actual workspace Gateway credits if choosing a supported native model node instead. After a one-time durable server claim, HTTP 202 means processing only. The connected path continues through the model and signed callback; only that callback creates a pending-review report. Model, validation and callback errors send signed enum-only failures. Jobs time out durably; ambiguous claimed timeouts require inspection. Explicit terminal-failure retries allocate one new job. Do not retry an accepted execution automatically. Saved execution data is disabled; do not pin health aggregates."
